# Shift+Tab while editing a middle task makes it the project's next sibling while the tasks after it stay in the project.
file <<END
Trip:
	- Passport
	- Tickets
	- Charger
Home:
	- Water plants
END
keys j j <Enter> <S-Tab> <Esc>
see ▌ - Tickets
quit
saved <<END
Trip:
	- Passport
	- Charger
- Tickets
Home:
	- Water plants
END
